{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"13081","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v16151","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"藤原々々","creatorId":"vndb:s2289","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:248","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2289","name":"藤原々々","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:119758","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"十睡みちたか","creatorId":"vndb:s4490","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:15662","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4490","name":"十睡みちたか","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:226295","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"藤原々々","creatorId":"vndb:s2289","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2289","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2289","name":"藤原々々","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:114565","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c27960","characterName":"ゆのは","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11341","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1337"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26740"],"vndbCharacterId":"c27960"},"originalCharacterName":"ゆのは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Self-proclaimed goddess of Yunohana Town. Pretends to be the protagonist's sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27960"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ゆのはな町』に棲む自称\"土地神さま\"。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女装束のような珍妙な格好をしているが霊感の無い者には普通の服装に見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名目上は拓也の妹ということになっており、監視と称して何かと付きまとってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見すると素直で天真爛漫に見えるが、その実態はアコギな守銭奴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その口調こそ丁寧だが、さりげなくドギツい言葉を会話の端々に織り交ぜたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"賽銭箱型の貯金箱を持ち歩いており、拓也がバイトで得た賃金を問答無用で徴収していく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貯まったお金の音を聞くのが何よりの楽しみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世知辛い現代を生き抜くために、ギブアンドテイクを信条としている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技は嘘泣きと三文芝居。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『冬を司る』神さまだと名乗っている割には、寒さが大の苦手であり、コタツの中でゴロゴロしたり、お風呂に入ることが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この世にお金で買えないものなんてありません。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神さまのわたしが言うんだから間違いありません！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26740","sourceWorkId":"4497","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称是栖息在『ゆのはな町』的“土地神大人”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穿着一身类似巫女装束的稀奇古怪的打扮，但没有灵感的人看上去只是普通的服装。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名义上算是拓也的妹妹，以监视为幌子老是缠着他。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11341"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/138326b034a67d1ce40a8db1d3eb3a4e115eb9f168f23218702688ef60fafa96.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5f959c51d60bb036121c358c17a53aeac63e08610fdc99e552617a490dfaac3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"七原 ことみ","creatorId":"vndb:s1070","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1070","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1070","name":"島村 香織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61199","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c27963","characterName":"桂沢 穂波","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11343","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1337"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26743"],"vndbCharacterId":"c27963"},"originalCharacterName":"桂沢 穂波","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"商店街の中にある喫茶店『白摘茶房（しろつめさぼう）』の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『白摘茶房』では、ウエイトレスの手伝いをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親の榛名（はるな）とは、母娘というより姉妹のような接し方をしており、憧憬の念を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"店を閉めた後に、榛名の炒れてくれたコーヒーを飲みながら雑談することが楽しみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数が少ないためにクールな印象を与えがちだが、実は好奇心旺盛な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"礼儀正しく口調も丁寧なため、少し大人びた雰囲気を漂わせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の気持ちをストレートに語るよりも「～なのです」という解説口調を好んで使うが、心を許して内面を語るときなどは、「～なんです」とくだけた感じになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"早くに父親を亡くしているため、商店街の皆のことを家族のように思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、わかばや椿も、穂波のことを妹のように可愛がっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"わかばの描く絵本の数少ない理解者の一人である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃より霊感が強く、みんなには見えないモノが見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆのはの招待についても薄々気付いており、拓也とセットで興味を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「コーヒーには、お砂糖を入れない派なのです」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26743","sourceWorkId":"4497","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"位于商店街的饮茶店『白摘茶房（しろつめさぼう）』的女儿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在『白摘茶房』帮手做女侍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和母亲榛名（はるな）与其说是母女，不如说像是姐妹一般相处，对她怀有憧憬之感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"关门以后，一边品尝着榛名冲泡的咖啡一边拉扯些家长里短是乐趣所在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为话不多的关系常给人冷漠的印象，但其实是好奇心旺盛的性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11343"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddf4c809b01c24ea1d24c1511c8045cd139545227ec69fcfd4b727276fa14660.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/315ba9ad318d5a8be75b10f1c538b415bd5a24197fc91ddda340a40b7b5f56c0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木葉 楓","creatorId":"vndb:s471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s471","name":"力丸 乃りこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61194","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32658","characterName":"リーダ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"1075","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1088"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10407"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32658"},"originalCharacterName":"リーダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A maid born in Russia. She is in charge of taking care of the main characters and heroines, and speaks honorifics to everyone in the academy. She also serves as a watchdog and an education officer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on DLsite"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32658"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロシア生まれのメイドさん。愛称はリーダ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院を創設した風祭家に代々仕えていた執事の家系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで物静かな性格。しかし怒るととても怖い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事全般のプロであり、礼儀作法なども完璧にマスターしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公やヒロインたちの世話を一手に引き受けており、学院内の誰に対しても敬語で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、理事長代理という立場にあるみやびの、お目付役と教育係を兼ねている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10407","sourceWorkId":"7402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"来自於俄罗斯的侍女，昵称为莉妲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出身於执事家系，代代都服侍著创设学院的风祭家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"个性温柔而且文静，不过生起气来非常可怕。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"1075"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01c256775387db75e1771f81c9d0607b8fd8b8e5e726748c9dbbc4b7f33d6f5c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b11badebd377e64944a18d58e6631980d982860f561ce9c05cefa3e33f64c8b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天川 みるく","creatorId":"vndb:s573","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s573","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s573","name":"天川 みるく","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61196","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c768","characterName":"風祭 みやび","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"1065","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1088"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10399"],"vndbCharacterId":"c768"},"originalCharacterName":"風祭 みやび","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"5月3日"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The principal of the school and a stubborn little girl. She isn’t acknowledged by the people around her due to her age and trusts only her maid (who’s also her only friend). She absolutely loves baseball."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Calamitous Intent's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c768"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"単純・短気・短絡的の三冠王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院を創設した風祭家の出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その言動は一見ワガママに映るが、本人は理事長代理の義務を果たそうと必死。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫かぶりが得意でエレガントに振舞っているが、ちょっとしたトラブルに直面すると、すぐに化けの皮がはがれてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一族の期待に応えようとする余り、少々ルールにうるさい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10399","sourceWorkId":"7402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“凰华女学园分校”代理理事长，同时也是该校的一名学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"个性蛮横，在执行理事长职务时，常与他人发生争执，经常比中指。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"单纯、性急又草率的三冠王。出身于创立学院的风祭家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然言行看来任性，本人却是拼命要完成理事长代理的职务。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"擅长把自己伪装起来，并且表现出非常优雅的样子，不过只要面对一点小问题马上就会洩了底。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于想要回应家族的期待，有点执着于遵守规则。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"1065"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32eb21c9149a480b5e53d01bd08ddbd17dd1720b69affdb8635a8e09c72a7546.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/336bf4bf7aaab3d51313c9dfbcf49eed36ed81ce892d828cd2f1a1cb8daa390f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61193","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c769","characterName":"八乙女 梓乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"1067","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1088"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10401"],"vndbCharacterId":"c769"},"originalCharacterName":"八乙女 梓乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"6月21日"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who’s afraid of other people, to the point that she can’t be touched by anyone besides her best friend. She excels at cooking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Calamitous Intent's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c769"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おしとやかな大和撫子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし極度の対人恐怖症。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもおどおどと何かに怯えており、唯一心を許した殿子の影に隠れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分から決断する事は少なく、常に周囲に流される。だからこそ周囲の急激な変化を恐れ、安定した現状に閉塞したいと願っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、場慣れしていないため非常にドジで不器用。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10401","sourceWorkId":"7402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"个性内向，温柔贤淑的女性代表。然而却有极端的“对人恐惧症”。目前是“校史编纂委员会”的成员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是惊慌地害怕着某些事情，躲在她唯一能敞开心房的殿子身后。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"很少自己做决定，总是顺着其他人的意见。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"也因此害怕周围出现急遽的改变，希望能封闭于安稳的现状。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外因为会怯场，因此做事非常笨拙总是会犯些奇妙的错。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"1067"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/4825c7e91b723768fe724e95dca9efee2bcae927f782cd565fd340cce2b70af5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d01c3f76276c68e354bb595ba7a56cfb2fd3b6d7f833082d865e9146548dc53d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐本 二厘","creatorId":"vndb:s794","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s794","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s794","name":"結下 みちる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61197","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c770","characterName":"鷹月 殿子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"1066","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1088"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10400"],"vndbCharacterId":"c770"},"originalCharacterName":"鷹月 殿子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"6月7日"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shino’s best friend who’s very smart, however, she’s quite distant from people and always protects Shino."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was voted the most popular girl in the game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Calamitous Intent's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c770"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に大人びており、暴走するみやびを不機嫌にさせずに止められる数少ない人間の1人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1つの事に捕らわれない、自由で大らかな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし大らかすぎてなにを考えているのか解りにくく、また1つの事に捕らわれなさ過ぎて、すぐにフラフラとどこかへ行ってしまうのが難点。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しばしば、学院南端にある高台から海を眺めている姿が目撃される。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10400","sourceWorkId":"7402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"崇尚自由，个性成熟。八乙女 梓乃的唯一好友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"个性非常成熟，是能够让失控的雅镇静下来，并且让她不会生气的少数人之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不会受到同一件事情所局限，自由并且大而化之的个性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然而她的麻烦之处，就在于因为过于大而化之，很难理解她在想些什么，而且因为过于不会受到局限，随时都会不晓得晃到哪里去。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经常有人目击到她站在学院南边的高台眺望大海。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"1066"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1d7dda4012072a2af8f8c945accbd7c3625389dd47ac0c5c48cc142167da7a2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/373eaf4d9d7dc5a735223f9c0716275b3335b6a0a2cab287367feea74a895b75.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遠山 枝里子","creatorId":"vndb:s240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s240","name":"今井 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61195","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c771","characterName":"仁礼 栖香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"1069","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1088"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10403"],"vndbCharacterId":"c771"},"originalCharacterName":"仁礼 栖香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"10月29日"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sophisticated lady who is relied upon by many people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Calamitous Intent's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c771"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭脳明晰な上に運動神経にも優れ、文武両道を地で行く優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の感情をあまり表に出そうとしないため、クールな印象を与えることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超が付くほど生真面目かつ几帳面な性格であり、融通がきかないため、影では『委員長』や『寮の標準時』といったあだ名を付けられているが、分校系の学院生たちからは何かと頼りにされる存在。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10403","sourceWorkId":"7402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"头脑聪明加上运动神经良好，是名文武全才的优等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于很少将自己的感情表露在外，经常给人冷酷的印象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于个性超级正直而且一板一眼，加上对於事情很难通融，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此暗地被取了『委员长』或是『宿舍标准时间』之类的绰号，不过在分校系的学生之间是相当可靠的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校中的优等生，个性认真严谨，被“仁礼”这个家道中落的家族所束缚。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"1069"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72f0b3d2b62b234c17881f88bd201630e7c7909474b676446a26785dd8ffb249.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86e5787428174f2b6d34332ce31781b226cf95aaf6290b7b6cfca9a0be82be8d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井村屋 ほのか","creatorId":"vndb:s867","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s867","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s867","name":"萩原 えみこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61198","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p76","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:689","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p76","name":"PULLTOP","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:13081:689","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p76","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p76","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p76","name":"PULLTOP","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:42453:v16151","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p76","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p76","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p76","name":"PULLTOP","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:6242:v16151","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":[],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
